ng content for  them there may be some consulting work  although i hate doing consulting because  it's just time for money but totally  yeah yeah i understand but it's usually  so like i just did a dell twitter chat  so dell is trying to reach out to the  entrepreneur market it's all value-added  they're not selling anything but they're  trying to be seen as a friend of  entrepreneur so so the first thing you  did was become a magnetic  force for the entrepreneurial community  right and once you got a following then  you could turn around and sell that to  partners is that how that worked  absolutely although i don't even do any  selling these guys are coming to me  right but i mean you needed to create  that magnetic field otherwise they  wouldn't have so so for if you're  listening out there the the key is what  community do you want to surround  yourself with and what kind of  compelling content are you going to  create that's going to get you the  numbers that then bring in the big boys  that that sounds real so what evan's  uncovered is a couple of things one is  he went right to his source code he went  right to his passion to figure out what  it was he wanted to do so that he could  do it 24 7 without getting tired because  that's a sign that you're headed in the  right direction you don't get tired you  don't get bored and the other thing that  he did is he figured out to rachel's  point his market  he knew exactly who he wanted to talk to  and then it becomes a whole lot easier  to have a voice in that market and evan  are you are you doing how-to for those  people are you giving them literally  that you know how to on the tools for  being entrepreneurs or what are you  teaching them  at a basic level it's a mix it's a mix  some people need the how-tos they need  to step by step and some people just  need  the motivation to keep going  you know yeah i see a lot of that  motivation on the site and i really like  it it can get a little self-help get a  little bit easy  but but you know what i can't get cheesy  enough with these guys i know it could  be cheesy but it works it worked for me  and i'm just sharing what worked for me  so a lot of people like it we believe it  that's cool too  all right well it's been great to have  you on the show evan  thank you guys  absolutely good luck with  evancarmichael.com

